      "content": "i mean i get that but i'm literally just sitting on my couch right now and i feel fine mostly. its just an itch. if i just take the benadryl and an extra shot of some liquid diphenhydramine i can probably just ride it out until tomorrow morning. i really dont want to deal with the hospital bill if this is just a snack allergy. can i just take 50mg of diphenhydramine plus my usual dose of antihistamines and be okay for the night?",
